{
 "events": [
  {
   "id": "N1",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 0.25,
   "end": 7.334,
   "text": "At 7:25 AM, November 6th, I was watching videos on my phone... when an unknown number texted me."
  },
  {
   "id": "U1",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 7.664,
   "end": 12.004,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     7.664,
     "At midnight, the world ends."
    ],
    [
     9.614,
     "Do exactly what I say, and you'll live."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N2",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 12.354,
   "end": 14.912,
   "text": "I thought it was a prank. Then it texted again."
  },
  {
   "id": "U2",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 15.342,
   "end": 17.672,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     15.342,
     "You're wearing the orange scarf right now."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N3",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 18.122,
   "end": 22.383,
   "text": "I was. How did it know that? I was home alone."
  },
  {
   "id": "U3",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 23.913,
   "end": 29.433,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     23.913,
     "Don't go to school today."
    ],
    [
     25.473,
     "Buy water, canned food, batteries."
    ],
    [
     28.083,
     "Go. NOW."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "H1",
   "kind": "H",
   "t": 29.683,
   "end": 30.913,
   "text": "who is this??"
  },
  {
   "id": "U4",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 31.193,
   "end": 33.083,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     31.193,
     "No time."
    ],
    [
     32.253,
     "Trust me."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N4",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 33.533,
   "end": 40.024,
   "text": "So I went. The store was empty. The cashier kept coughing. And his eyes... were yellow."
  },
  {
   "id": "JS1",
   "kind": "S",
   "t": 40.124,
   "end": 41.824
  },
  {
   "id": "U5",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 41.954,
   "end": 46.814,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     41.954,
     "Don't touch him."
    ],
    [
     43.064,
     "Go home."
    ],
    [
     44.024,
     "Lock your door at exactly 11:58."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N5",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 47.264,
   "end": 49.581,
   "text": "11:58. I locked the door."
  },
  {
   "id": "N6",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 50.081,
   "end": 54.341,
   "text": "11:59. Every phone in the city started screaming."
  },
  {
   "id": "N7",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 54.791,
   "end": 56.66,
   "text": "Then the real screaming started."
  },
  {
   "id": "U6",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 58.09,
   "end": 62.85,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     58.09,
     "RULE 1: Don't open the door. For anyone."
    ],
    [
     61.4,
     "Not even people you know."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N8",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 63.4,
   "end": 69.551,
   "text": "Day 3. Someone knocked. It was Mr. Hale, my neighbor. He was begging me to let him in."
  },
  {
   "id": "N9",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 70.051,
   "end": 73.829,
   "text": "My hand was already on the lock... when my phone buzzed."
  },
  {
   "id": "U7",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 74.409,
   "end": 74.979,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     74.409,
     "Don't."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N10",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 75.979,
   "end": 79.605,
   "text": "I didn't open it. 10 seconds later, he stopped begging."
  },
  {
   "id": "JS2",
   "kind": "S",
   "t": 79.705,
   "end": 81.905
  },
  {
   "id": "N10b",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 82.005,
   "end": 83.501,
   "text": "And started scratching."
  },
  {
   "id": "U8",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 84.931,
   "end": 88.841,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     84.931,
     "RULE 2: The roof. 3 AM."
    ],
    [
     87.941,
     "Come alone."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N11",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 89.341,
   "end": 96.459,
   "text": "3 AM. Something was buzzing over the city. A drone. It dropped a box, right at my feet."
  },
  {
   "id": "N12",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 96.959,
   "end": 105.233,
   "text": "Inside: a radio, a flashlight, and a map. One place was circled in red. The bridge. Day 30."
  },
  {
   "id": "N13",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 106.133,
   "end": 108.103,
   "text": "Day 12. The power died."
  },
  {
   "id": "U9",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 109.533,
   "end": 112.993,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     109.533,
     "RULE 3: They're drawn to light."
    ],
    [
     111.783,
     "Keep the curtains shut."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N14",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 113.393,
   "end": 118.935,
   "text": "Across the street, someone turned on a flashlight. 30 seconds later... it went out."
  },
  {
   "id": "N15",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 119.835,
   "end": 126.165,
   "text": "Day 18. Trucks. Men in white suits, with a logo I'd never seen before."
  },
  {
   "id": "N16",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 126.615,
   "end": 130.066,
   "text": "They weren't killing the zombies. They were collecting them."
  },
  {
   "id": "N17",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 130.566,
   "end": 133.537,
   "text": "Then one of them looked up. Right at my window."
  },
  {
   "id": "U10",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 133.867,
   "end": 135.527,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     133.867,
     "GET DOWN."
    ],
    [
     134.847,
     "NOW."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N18",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 136.527,
   "end": 139.038,
   "text": "Day 23. I had to ask."
  },
  {
   "id": "H2",
   "kind": "H",
   "t": 139.388,
   "end": 141.218,
   "text": "why are you helping me?"
  },
  {
   "id": "U11",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 141.648,
   "end": 142.778,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     141.648,
     "Because I owe you."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "H3",
   "kind": "H",
   "t": 143.028,
   "end": 144.138,
   "text": "who ARE you"
  },
  {
   "id": "U12",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 144.768,
   "end": 147.568,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     144.768,
     "You used to be scared of thunder."
    ],
    [
     146.598,
     "You still are."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "JS3",
   "kind": "S",
   "t": 147.568,
   "end": 149.168
  },
  {
   "id": "N19",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 149.418,
   "end": 152.283,
   "text": "How did they know that? Nobody knew that."
  },
  {
   "id": "U13",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 153.413,
   "end": 158.673,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     153.413,
     "Tomorrow. 6 AM."
    ],
    [
     155.573,
     "Get to the bridge."
    ],
    [
     156.443,
     "Don't stop. Don't look back."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N20",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 159.073,
   "end": 161.035,
   "text": "My phone was at 1%."
  },
  {
   "id": "N21",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 161.935,
   "end": 167.758,
   "text": "Day 30. I ran. I didn't stop. And they heard every single step."
  },
  {
   "id": "N22",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 168.258,
   "end": 171.964,
   "text": "I made it to the bridge. It was empty. Nobody was there."
  },
  {
   "id": "N23",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 172.564,
   "end": 173.873,
   "text": "Then my phone buzzed."
  },
  {
   "id": "U14",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 174.503,
   "end": 175.993,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     174.503,
     "Turn around."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "JS4",
   "kind": "S",
   "t": 175.993,
   "end": 180.193
  },
  {
   "id": "N24",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 180.293,
   "end": 183.283,
   "text": "Behind me... was a man in a white suit."
  },
  {
   "id": "N25",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 184.783,
   "end": 188.842,
   "text": "Who is the unknown number? Comment your guess. Follow for part 2."
  }
 ],
 "story_end": 189.242,
 "total": 191.842
}